---

<script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-KFGQ1WS6YS"
></script>
<script is:inline>
  // console.log("gtag");
  function gtag() {
    dataLayer.push(arguments);
  }
  ((window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || []),
    gtag("js", new Date()),
    gtag("config", "G-KFGQ1WS6YS"));
</script>
<link
  href="https://unpkg.com/boxicons@2.1.4/css/boxicons.min.css"
  rel="stylesheet"
/>

<Layout
  title="Music Annex | TCNJ"
  image="hero-final.jpg"
  description="The Music Annex aims to create a place for the college's talented, ever-growing ensembles to call their own. When completed, this modern structure will offer a 2,500-square-foot rehearsal room featuring 20-foot ceilings and safe, state-of-the-art acoustics, all while maintaining the signature look and feel of TCNJ’s campus."
>
  <main>
    <!-- <TopTakeoverBar client:load /> -->
    <Header />
    <Intro
      body="“There’s this kind of magic that happens when you perform with other people. And it happens here at TCNJ every day.”"
      buttonText="Give Today"
      buttonLink="https://give.tcnj.edu/musicannex/"
      heroImage="hero-2026/hero-final.jpg"
    />

    <QuoteBody idName="tcnj-spirit" scholarship={true} client:load>
      <p>
        That word — magic — speaks volumes about the caliber of TCNJ’s music
        program. It also perfectly describes what happens as word continues to
        spread about the college’s many ensembles. Their impressive reputation
        entices students in majors throughout the college — well beyond the
        music program — to join and further their musical passion at a high
        level.
      </p>
      <p>
        However, the ensembles have outgrown both the actual size and the noise
        capacity of their practice location. These students are left without a
        permanent home, shuffling equipment from building to building and
        sharing limited available space with other student groups.
      </p>
      <p>
        The Music Annex aims to create just that: a place for these talented,
        ever-growing ensembles to call their own. When completed, this modern
        structure will offer a 2,500-square-foot rehearsal room featuring
        20-foot ceilings and safe, state-of-the-art acoustics, all while
        maintaining the signature look and feel of TCNJ’s campus.
      </p>
    </QuoteBody>

    <CarouselContainer
      carouselImages={[
        {
          image:
            "https://tcnj.edu/custom/campaigns/new-pavilion-images/gallery-2026/render-03.jpg",
          alt: "Rendering 3",
        },
        {
          image:
            "https://tcnj.edu/custom/campaigns/new-pavilion-images/gallery-2026/render-01.jpg",
          alt: "Rendering 1",
        },
        {
          image:
            "https://tcnj.edu/custom/campaigns/new-pavilion-images/gallery-2026/render-02.jpg",
          alt: "Rendering 2",
        },
        {
          image:
            "https://tcnj.edu/custom/campaigns/new-pavilion-images/gallery-2026/render-04.jpg",
          alt: "Rendering 4",
        },
        {
          image:
            "https://tcnj.edu/custom/campaigns/new-pavilion-images/gallery-2026/render-05.jpg",
          alt: "Rendering 5",
        },
        {
          image:
            "https://tcnj.edu/custom/campaigns/new-pavilion-images/gallery-2026/render-06.jpg",
          alt: "Rendering 6",
        },
      ]}
      client:load
    >
      <!-- <div id="carousel-body">
        <p>
          The space will feature a retractable, garage-like door and materials
          that blend with the environment while maintaining the signature look
          and feel of TCNJ’s campus.
        </p> -->
      <!-- <a class="button-link">Download TCNJ Pavilion Campaign Overview</a> -->
      <!-- </div> -->
    </CarouselContainer>
  </main>
  <GiveBanner scholarship={false} client:load>
    <h2>Giving Opportunities</h2>
    <p>
      You can help bring this creative vision to life. Whether through an
      individual gift or a sponsorship, there are numerous ways to lend your
      support to the creation of TCNJ’s new Music Annex.
    </p>
    <a class="button-link" href="https://give.tcnj.edu/musicannex/"
      >Give Online</a
    >
    <!-- <Accodion
        client:load
        idName="naming-opps"
        header="View the full list of naming opportunities"
        startOpen={false}
      >
        <p>Content here</p>
      </Accodion> -->
  </GiveBanner>
  <Footer client:load />
</Layout>
